OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FA family are facing a desperate race
OL,7,Fto raise #245,000 before Christmas to
OL,8,Fsecure life-changing heart surgery in
OL,9,Fthe USA for their teenage son.
OL,11,FFinley Cormack was born with a rare
OL,12,Fcongenital heart condition called
OL,13,FEbstein's Anomaly, and has spent his
OL,14,Flife going to hospital appointments
OL,15,Fand having major open heart surgery.
OL,17,FThe 19-year-old's mum Clare says the
OL,18,Fteenager from Prenton, Wirral "has
OL,19,Fnever been able to live a normal life"
OL,20,Fand is restrained by fatigue and
OL,21,Fbreathlessness.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FThe family have set up a fundraiser
OL,7,Fcalled "All in for Fin" and are
OL,8,Fbalancing their full-time jobs with
OL,9,Forganising events to raise money.
OL,11,FPeople born with Ebstein's Anomaly
OL,12,Fhave an abnormality of the tricuspid
OL,13,Fvalve in the heart.
OL,15,FThe valve leaks and is displaced
OL,16,Ftowards the bottom of the heart,
OL,17,Fcausing breathlessness and episodes
OL,18,Fwhere his oxygen levels fall so low
OL,19,Fthat he becomes blue.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FFinley's mum said: "He comes home,
OL,7,Fhe'll have dinner, and quite often
OL,8,Fgoes straight to bed because he's just
OL,9,Fexhausted.
OL,11,F"So it's just fighting that exhaustion
OL,12,Fall the time, so he doesn't really
OL,13,Fhave a quality of life."
OL,15,FShe added: "He's never been able to
OL,16,Fkeep up with friends and things, so he
OL,17,Fcouldn't go on bike rides, walks, play
OL,18,Ffootball, or do any team sports.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,F"He would go out with his friends and
OL,7,Fgo for a walk and end up fainting at
OL,8,Fthe end of the walk because he just
OL,9,Fcouldn't do it."
OL,11,FFinley was just 11 days old when he
OL,12,Funderwent his first open-heart surgery
OL,13,Fat Alder Hey Children's Hospital after
OL,14,Fspending the first three months of his
OL,15,Flife on a ventilator.
OL,17,FFurther complex surgery followed at
OL,18,FGreat Ormond Street Hospital when he
OL,19,Fwas four, before another major repair
OL,20,Fwhen he was 10.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FThe surgery at the Mayo Clinic,
OL,7,FMinnesota in the United States may not
OL,8,Fbe possible if his condition
OL,9,Fdeteriorates too far.
OL,11,FLeading congenital heart surgeon Dr
OL,12,FJoseph Dearani, Director of Paediatric
OL,13,Fand Adult Congenital Heart Surgery, is
OL,14,Finternationally recognised as one of
OL,15,Fthe world's experts in treating
OL,16,FEbstein's Anomaly and complex repeat
OL,17,Fheart surgery.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FThe operation offers the chance to
OL,7,Frepair Finley's heart and potentially
OL,8,Fgive him decades of additionalJlife
OL,9,Fbefore a transplant is needed.
OL,11,FBut Doctors in the US say surgery has
OL,12,Fto be done before Christmas as
OL,13,FFinley's condition is deteriorating.
OL,15,FFinley has had an assessment to
OL,16,Fdetermine if he is suitable for a
OL,17,Ffuture heart transplant.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FThe hospital have recommended that he
OL,7,Fis added to the transplant waiting
OL,8,Flist, but there is no guarantee that a
OL,9,Fsuitable donor heart would become
OL,10,Favailable in time.
OL,12,FIf a transplant were possible, he
OL,13,Fwould still face a life of taking anti-
OL,14,Frejection medication and the risk of
OL,15,Frejection at any stage.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FJoe Cormack, Finley's dad said: "It is
OL,7,Fa massive amount of money, it took the
OL,8,Fwind out of our sails when we realised
OL,9,Fit's a quarter of a million pounds,
OL,10,Fbut you've got no choice. You'd do
OL,11,Fanything for your kids.
OL,13,F"It's vital. He's had such a tough
OL,14,Flife to get to where he's got to. He's
OL,15,Fgot this wonderful opportunity now to
OL,16,Fgo to America and have one of the best
OL,17,Fsurgeons in the world for his
OL,18,Fcondition operate on him."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
