CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FFinley now works as a pizza chef at
OL,7,Fthe Elephant Lounge in Parkgate,
OL,8,FWirral. He can only work short shifts
OL,9,Fand has to take regular breaks to
OL,10,Fmanage his tiredness.
OL,12,FHe said: "I'm unable to help fully
OL,13,Flike the average person. I'm unable to
OL,14,Fbring stuff up like stock, like boxes
OL,15,Fand lift heavy things."
OL,17,FHe said it makes him feel
OL,18,F"disappointed in himself" and is a
OL,19,F"restraint" on his daily life.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FFinley's brother Jacob wanted to help
OL,7,Fhis family raise the money, and got
OL,8,Fhis school involved.
OL,10,FSt Joseph's Catholic Primary School in
OL,11,FBirkenhead hosted a "Wear Red for Fin"
OL,12,Fday, where the school all wore red and
OL,13,Fbrought in red gifts that could be
OL,14,Fraffled off to raise money.
OL,16,FJacob said: "It's very important
OL,17,Fbecause I really want to help my
OL,18,Fbrother Fin, because I love him and I
OL,19,Freally want him to be safe and
OL,20,Fhealthy."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FFinley's family said the surgery would
OL,7,Fdramatically improve his life and
OL,8,Fallow him to finally do the things
OL,9,Fhe's missed out on.
OL,11,FClare said: "He has no quality of
OL,12,Flife, and he's not like any other 19
OL,13,Fyear old, and it's not fair. He's
OL,14,Fnever been able to live a normal life.
OL,16,F"He'd just be able to do the normal
OL,17,Fthings that a young man would be able
OL,18,Fto do without that constant fear. As
OL,19,Fsoon as he gets breathless, the
OL,20,Fanxiety sets in that there's something
OL,21,Fwrong."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786380476
OL,3,CFamily's urgent appeal for teenager's
OL,4,Clife-saving heart surgery in US
OL,6,FFinley's family have already raised
OL,7,Fmore than #60,000, but still have just
OL,8,Fshort of #200,000 to find before
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FFinley said: "I'd like to be able to
OL,12,Fjust not feel ill all the time. I'd be
OL,13,Fable to be a do a lot more with my
OL,14,Ffamily.
OL,16,F"I'd be able to go out with friends
OL,17,Fmore often. And I wouldn't be held
OL,18,Fback with day-to-day life things."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
